OL,2,V55555555C'HUMAN TORCH' KILLERS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C JAILED FOR LIFE
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Victor Castigador has been jailed for
OL,6, life, meaning a minimum of 25 years,
OL,7, for the "human torch" murders of two
OL,8, Soho amusement arcade guards.
OL,10, Mr Justice Rougier at the Old Bailey
OL,11, told Castigador, 35: "I find it almost
OL,12, impossible to understand the workings
OL,13, of a mind as twisted and evil as yours"
OL,15, Calvin Nelson,20, and Paul Clinton, 18,
OL,16, who had denied murder, were both found
OL,17, guilty. Nelson is detained for life and
OL,18, Clinton at Her Majesty's Pleasure.
OL,20, Karen Dunn, 18, and Allison Woodside,
OL,21, 22, were cleared of murder.
OL,23,F]DFrom 28-02-90 / teletextarchive.com
