PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1772322956
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G5/9
OL,2,V55555555CTRADE FIGURES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CDISASTROUS - LABOUR
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Labour has strongly condemned the
OL,6, widening trade gap, calling for a
OL,7, Budget for investment in industry and
OL,8, in training.
OL,10, Shadow trade secretary Gordon Brown
OL,11, described the figures as disastrous -
OL,12, "the third worst in our history".
OL,14, They showed "the damage the complacent
OL,15, Government's high interest rates are
OL,16, doing".
OL,18, Liberal Democrat spokesman Matthew
OL,19, Taylor commented: "It is a disastrous
OL,20, lead in to Mr Major's first Budget and
OL,21, makes a mockery of claims that the Govt
OL,22, is turning round the economy."   C>>>>>
OL,23,F]DFrom 28-02-90 / teletextarchive.com
