OL,2,V55555555CCHARLES TO VISIT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CFLOOD-HIT N WALES
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Prince Charles is to break his Swiss
OL,6, ski-ing holiday to visit the flood-hit
OL,7, areas of North Wales on Thursday.
OL,9, A wide area around Towyn remains under
OL,10, water, but the gale-force winds have
OL,11, eased and it is hoped the worst of the
OL,12, battering from the sea is past.
OL,14, A huge high tide along the South Wales
OL,15, coast, which has been put on full flood
OL,16, alert, passed without causing serious
OL,17, flooding when the wind subsided.
OL,19,SGBritain will get #300,000 emergency
OL,20, aid from the EC to compensate storm-hit
OL,21, families, bringing the total money from
OL,22, Brussels since January to over #1.1m.
OL,23,F]DFrom 28-02-90 / teletextarchive.com
