OL,2,V55555555CSANDERSON AWARDED
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C#30,000 DAMAGES
OL,4,         C
OL,5, Athlete Tessa Sanderson, 33, has won
OL,6, #30,000 libel damages over claims she
OL,7, stole another woman's husband.
OL,9, When she realised she had won Miss
OL,10, Sanderson gasped "Thank God". Outside
OL,11, court she said her ordeal was like "the
OL,12, last throw of the Olympics".
OL,14, She had been accused by beautician
OL,15, Jewel Evans in The Sunday Mirror and
OL,16, The People of stealing her fitness
OL,17, trainer husband Derrick, 37.
OL,19, Mirror Group Newspapers, which faces an
OL,20, estimated costs bill of #200,000, was
OL,21, granted a 24-day stay on the award
OL,22, pending a possible appeal.
OL,23,F]DFrom 28-02-90 / teletextarchive.com
